      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The one who witnessed a horde of Corruption\r\nDemons in the forest... that would be Zolta,\r\npresently outside. She oft enters the forest to\r\ngather herbs, you see.",
        "Jp" : "森で侵食魔の群れを見たというのは\r\n外にいるゾルタです\r\n彼女はハーブを採りによく森へ\r\n入りますからね"
